        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Curse of Grandfather</strong> is an intense psychological horror experience.<br>At midnight, you return to your grandfather's house after years of absence. But the house is no longer the same. Every room holds a memory from the past, and every silence echoes with a whisper.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We add deeper interaction using the player’s microphone; your voice can trigger certain events in the house and heighten the tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the dark secrets of the house, you must find notes, keys, and mysterious books. But be careful… you are not alone in this house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal events and exploration-focused gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet impactful puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microphone-supported interaction: your voice can trigger events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound and environmental design that heightens tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, cinematic visuals powered by Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the darkness. But remember: this house is waiting for you… and it won’t let you leave.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Curse of Grandfather</strong> is an intense psychological horror experience.<br>At midnight, you return to your grandfather's house after years of absence. But the house is no longer the same. Every room holds a memory from the past, and every silence echoes with a whisper.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We add deeper interaction using the player’s microphone; your voice can trigger certain events in the house and heighten the tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the dark secrets of the house, you must find notes, keys, and mysterious books. But be careful… you are not alone in this house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal events and exploration-focused gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet impactful puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microphone-supported interaction: your voice can trigger events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound and environmental design that heightens tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, cinematic visuals powered by Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the darkness. But remember: this house is waiting for you… and it won’t let you leave.</p>",
